Did you bring peace to our companions?
I know it is hard, but we have to do it for them. Arteres went through something similar when she was controlled by Yaten. It is horrible to be forced to do what you do not want, even more so against your own kind.

I need you to use these Quintessence Magic Stones to capture the Shogoth's Manipulated Soul. They want to tell us something. We have to free them from this torment!

Please, bring the Manipulated Soul by hunting the Shogoth in the Abyss of the Sea.
